text = "your controlls are a to go left d to go right space/w to jump
what you do have:
-double jump
what your goals should be:
-collect all the strawberrys
-defeat all the bugs 
disclaimer:
-all of the strawberrys are reachable one way or another
there are some jump/strawberrys that are ridiculously hard to get(for the pro players)




p.s. some strawberrys need you to jump on bugs and perform a \"triple jump\" as the bugs make you jump when you jump on top of them :)"
